{"id":"n14987-1-7","stage":3,"title":"뒤늦다 · 晚","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14987-1-7-1","ko":"회사를 그만두고 대학원에 진학한다고?","zh":"你要辞职去读研究生了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"회사를","meaning":"公司，企业，会社","explanation":"회사：公司，企业，会社；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"회사","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31668","senseId":"1","lemma":"회사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"회사를","audio":"/audio/62f80adf2dcac5e0aace.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두고","meaning":"罢休，放弃","explanation":"그만두다：罢休，放弃；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"2","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두고","audio":"/audio/f30a0252b08903bab4ef.mp3"}},{"text":"대학원에","meaning":"研究生院","explanation":"대학원：研究生院；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"대학원","audio":"/audio/9986b156ac970834ed38.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66290","senseId":"1","lemma":"대학원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대학원에","audio":"/audio/51953f9b5808554d101a.mp3"}},{"text":"진학한다고?","meaning":"升学","explanation":"진학하다：升学；ㄴ다고：重复、强调或确认所说的内容；带 요 时为礼貌表达。","readings":[{"term":"진학하다","audio":"/audio/2f35bdc280fcce515074.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"76166","senseId":"1","lemma":"진학하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진학한다고","audio":"/audio/42849e35ffd550bb3aab.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a109dcd7f6f11c2e","term":"회사","zh":"公司，企业，会社","audio":"/audio/a109dcd7f6f11c2e1703.mp3","entryId":"31668","definition":"想要通过事业获得利益的许多人一起建立的法人团体。","pronunciation":["회ː사","훼ː사"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"罢休，放弃","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"不做打算以后要做的事情。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]},{"id":"9986b156ac970834","term":"대학원","zh":"研究生院","audio":"/audio/9986b156ac970834ed38.mp3","entryId":"66290","definition":"大学毕业的人接受专业教育、进行研究的机构。","pronunciation":["대ː하권"]},{"id":"2f35bdc280fcce51","term":"진학하다","zh":"升学","audio":"/audio/2f35bdc280fcce515074.mp3","entryId":"76166","definition":"指学生毕业某级别的学校后，进入比原来高一级的学校。","pronunciation":["진ː하카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/83bccb0a50531a63854d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14987-1-7-2","ko":"네. 뒤늦은 나이에 공부를 다시 하게 돼 걱정입니다.","zh":"是的。年纪这么大了还要重新开始学习，我有点担心。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"뒤늦은","meaning":"晚，迟","explanation":"뒤늦다：晚，迟；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"뒤늦다","audio":"/audio/89daf0d4e2e8c711d705.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14987","senseId":"1","lemma":"뒤늦다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뒤늦은","audio":"/audio/f1aee432c5f281c96df7.mp3"}},{"text":"나이에","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나이에","audio":"/audio/167a58297400ecdc5209.mp3"}},{"text":"공부를","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부를","audio":"/audio/6cf72634fef36a3407ff.mp3"}},{"text":"다시","meaning":"又，重新","explanation":"다시：又，重新","readings":[{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62539","senseId":"6","lemma":"다시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다시","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3"}},{"text":"하게","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하게","audio":"/audio/21b4af0207cfd591c511.mp3"}},{"text":"돼","meaning":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","explanation":"되다：变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"7","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"돼","audio":"/audio/9a156a11ed02d98f483a.mp3"}},{"text":"걱정입니다.","meaning":"担心，忧虑，担忧","explanation":"걱정：担心，忧虑，担忧；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"걱정","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17232","senseId":"1","lemma":"걱정","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걱정입니다","audio":"/audio/a73c60248aa4e13b9526.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"89daf0d4e2e8c711","term":"뒤늦다","zh":"晚，迟","audio":"/audio/89daf0d4e2e8c711d705.mp3","entryId":"14987","definition":"过了干某事合适的时候。","pronunciation":["뒤ː늗따"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"920b0d402f08f1fb","term":"다시","zh":"又，重新","audio":"/audio/920b0d402f08f1fbae95.mp3","entryId":"62539","definition":"从头开始重做。","pronunciation":["다시"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"变得、最终处于某种情况（-게 되다）","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]}],"audio":"/audio/c728d4f98b3efa03ad56.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.233,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=14987","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":119,"sequenceScore":3.7097,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["是的。年纪这么大了还要重新开始学习，我有点担心。","听说核电站的废弃物不能随便丢弃，对吧？","你要辞职去读研究生了？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["是的。年纪这么大了还要重新开始学习，我有点担心。","你要辞职去读研究生了？","听说核电站的废弃物不能随便丢弃，对吧？"],"answer":0}]}
